<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Minecraft-Stun Slam</Major>
    <Description>Minecraft Sword-Axe-Mace Stun Slam!
What does this mod do?
*This particular mod does the 3 weapon switch from Sword, to Axe, and lastly the Mace!
Why do we need the sword for the stun slam?
*We need to harness the Sword's cooldown for a solid and quick hit of axe so that we can stun the shield of our enemy and succesfuly mace them.
Simply put your Sword to slot 1, Axe to slot 2, and mace to slot 3 for you to do this mod.
Thank you!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
